<title>DUBAI: Iran to host May international oil and gas meeting.</title>
<headline>Iran to host May international oil and gas meeting.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran will host an international conference on oil and gas in the Middle East in the central city of Isfahan on May 8-10, the head of the National Iranian Oil Company's (NIOC) exploration department said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Mehdi Husseini, quoted by the official Iranian news agency IRNA, said the oil ministers of Iran, Qatar, Kuwait, Nigeria and Turkey were expected to address the conference.</p>
<p>He said some 200 oil and gas experts would attend the conference, which would study issues concerning gas reserves in the Middle East, international investment in oil and marketing.</p>
<p>IRNA gave no further details.</p>
</text>
